  // Screen 26 - Daily Rewards (the owner's mockup of 8 Oct 2026; the designer's 26-daily-rewards-prompt.md).
  // Rects are mockup pixels on 26-daily-rewards.png. Nothing is cut from the mockup. Shared menu
  // background and UI kit: the back disc and icon, the wallet capsule and coin (as on Earn Coins), the
  // title divider (a diamond and one line sprite, mirrored on the left), the plain ivory card stretched
  // to the big panel (26's panel has no textile corners), the crimson gold-rimmed button (the main menu's
  // Play Online pill), the kit's soft coin light (Day 1's sun) and the kit's hairline for the footer.
  // The DailyRewards batch (ChatGPT-generated, ArtSource/Working/DailyRewards/notes.md; import settings in
  // ArtSource/Kit/DailyRewards.json): the day tile, the wide weekly-bonus tile, the today overlay (the
  // crimson keyline and Day 1's warmer inside, laid over whichever tile is claimable), the coins of each
  // day with their contact shadows, the laurel (mirrored on the right), the empty gold ribbon and the
  // heading flourish (mirrored on the right).
  // Every word is a label. Title, subtitle and "Weekly bonus" are fixed copy (keys below); the balance,
  // "Day 1 of 7", the day names, the amounts, the button's "Claim 10 Coins" and the footer line are
  // written by the presenter. Arrays are id + day index 0-6 (Day 1 = 0). The today look is built on
  // Tile0 (visible TodayFrame0 and CoinGlow0, as on the mockup); the other days carry the same two
  // nodes hidden, at the rect the overlay takes on that tile (the tile's rect grown by 2.105 left/right
  // and 1.425 top/bottom). On the mockup DayLabel0 and DayLabel6 are crimson, the others dark brown;
  // the builder takes each label's measured colour.
  // capFit / xFit / dilate / lineGradient / mirror are applied by ScreenExtras.Apply (customizer).
  "name": "DailyRewards",
  "mockup": "26-daily-rewards.png",
